# Render's repo-root Docker context must never contain secrets/runtime data.
.git
**/.venv
**/venv
**/node_modules
**/.cache
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/dist
**/build
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.db
**/*.db-*
**/*.sqlite*
**/*.mp4
**/*.avi
**/*.mov
**/*.mkv
**/uploads
**/evidence
**/tests
hack
runs
training
# The image copies only the two existing .pt models required at runtime.
**/*.onnx
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
**/.netrc
**/.npmrc
**/.ssh
**/.git-credentials
**/*.pem
**/*.key
